  "name": "Igor - Grenade Trader with Quests",
  "slug": "igor-grenade-trader-with-quests",
  "teaser": "A trader who sells & buys grenades.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1540.jpg",
  "downloads": 3393,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<h3><em><strong>This mod is compatible with 3.9.X</strong></em></h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PYCAKLOVESCODE/IgorTrader/main/IgorImage1.PNG\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PYCAKLOVESCODE/IgorTrader/main/IgorImage1.PNG\" alt=\"IgorImage1.PNG\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Igor sells &amp; buys grenades, grenade launchers, grenade launcher ammo, gunpowder and everything else explosive.</strong><br />\n<strong>This mod comes with 6 available quests - More quests comming soon</strong></p>\n<p>How to Install:</p>\n<p>[1] Install the Mod from Github</p>\n<p>[2] Unzip the file</p>\n<p>[3] In the unzipped file (folder) you will find a folder called “user”</p>\n<p><strong>[4] Drag and Drop the “user” folder into your SPT-AKI folder (Where all the .exe files are located)</strong></p>\n<p>[5] Enjoy</p>\n<p><em><strong>If you want to change prices you can do this in the mod.js file<br />\nIf you want to use this mod in a modpack, or anywhere else / or edit it, please ask for permission first, thanks.</strong></em></p>\n",
